#! tui-mockup 1
#! size: 180x48
#! caps: attrs=bold,dim,italic,underline,inverse colors=truecolor glyphs=unicode source=docs
#! title: osi — all · tape on every tile
#! state: tape
#! theme: catppuccin-mocha
#! note: data: six real orchestrations launched together by demo/multi/launch6.sh, four on cof and two on electricity, snapshotted 2.8 s in
#! note: invented: nothing; names, configs, pids, timings and tokens are the engines' own (snap6/manifest.json is what osi knew at launch)
#! note: every tile is a full osi on one run; the 0-3 keys switch the screen of every tile at once; arrows move the focus; enter opens the focused run
#! note: craft-ok CR6 tiles are sized by the grid, not by the shortest run; a tile's empty rows are where that run's steps will appear
#! region r1 header 0,0,180,1
#! region r2 list 0,2,60,21 Tape · 1 Done · 1 Running · 10 Ahead · ▰ = 50 t
#! region r3 list 60,2,60,21 Tape · 1 Done · 1 Running · 10 Ahead · ▰ = 50 t
