#! region r6 list 60,24,60,22 Tape · 3 Done · 1 Running · 1 Ahead · ▰ = 50 t
#! region r7 list 120,24,60,22 Tape · 10 Done · 2 Running · 1 Ahead · ▰ = 50 t
#! region r8 keybar 0,47,180,1
#! focus r2
